# Signature limit

A single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only. [[cite:obs-6d0dde337971c5d25cb5650c373f16060fd8b619 "Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only."]]

Where the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies. [[cite:obs-6d0dde337971c5d25cb5650c373f16060fd8b619 "Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only."]]
